{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fc9e2890402600d43ba2e2077758a125db4c7a34afc1b72dab834bcf6172e0ee", "ja": "公演初日、無事に新曲を歌いきった3人。\n瑞希は、締めのMCでちょっと滑ってしまう。\n手品でごまかそうと紬、志保にアシスタント\nを求めるが、プロデューサーの合図で\n止められる。", "zh": "三人在公演首日顺利唱完新歌。\n瑞希在最后的主持环节不小心冷场，\n她想表演魔术蒙混过去，\n便拜托䌷、志保担任助手，\n但在制作人的示意下遭到制止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b33da16f81094e0f3e4f864fd807f8884bfcfef83ce2a6354ff5f0520f4fc6ee", "ja": "（EScapeの初日公演が終わった。ステージ上の\n3人へと、惜しみない拍手が注がれている）", "zh": "（『EScape』的首日公演结束了。\n观众献上源源不绝的掌声给舞台上的三人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6290ce8e13e50ee1d7f0e57a66cc290f2d2ef7ab3f8ab25362a0bfae71c69af1", "ja": "（さあ、後は締めのMCだ……頑張れ、みんな！）", "zh": "（好了，只剩下最后的主持环节……大家加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "a48792ab2d6de5a6f754a911918088a98ea8a3350212b02361c1d66c905ad1a8", "ja": "みなさん。\n私達、EScapeの新曲、いかがでしたか？", "zh": "各位喜欢我们『EScape』的新歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1003_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "160d04390c1d43d1035f19afb6b5881a40fae00d7e2eea2baf4b5a8e6769b0a4", "ja": "ワーーーッ！", "zh": "哗───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "72bfacc4a73e23dc6b02b1eaa6c43aa7db7a712e159336b475dd70ba95d14676", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n楽しんでいただけたら、何よりです。", "zh": "谢谢大家。\n你们喜欢就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4241b6d258f2cf6a9237733e720305d50130a50867f67a86da5972bc17b65155", "ja": "公演はいつも、新しいことの連続なのですが……。\n今回もまた、初めての経験ばかりでした。", "zh": "公演总是带给我们接连不断的新挑战……\n这次也同样充满全新的体验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "9b69b3caa59041e14b6a1de8e044b212c6bf2716152487a366e574540375e4f1", "ja": "具体的には、PVの撮影をしました。\nとても、いいものができたんじゃないかと思います。", "zh": "具体而言，就是我们有拍摄PV。\n我想应该会是非常棒的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc4c3a83e245be08135cdefa3c2cba1937811a8c9185fc1b8c97ca836e5054ce", "ja": "緊張もしましたし、苦労もありましたが……\n終わってみると、あっと言う間でしたね。", "zh": "在这期间，我们曾紧张过，也曾吃过苦头……\n但结束后再回头一看，这段期间竟是眨眼就结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "690cf4ca6b23dadbc65f4855418549de0716f500b0d6c7723e31e85e3c67f82d", "ja": "はい。無事に終わって、安堵しています。\n……アンドロイドだけに。", "zh": "是的，顺利结束后，就像「仿生人」一样……\n「放生了」不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "c3a35e048bd7b15a71a230cec5e73307bcee7c078f002662a086541cf555ca07", "ja": "瑞希さん……？", "zh": "瑞希……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1010_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "9bebaba67157bec01532b60c97e895107832991224b3632a07e9fedb567b1db0", "ja": "ザワザワ……ザワザワ……。", "zh": "吵杂……吵杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "866d0199f4993a299f08a0a2d2f7becaa0b23c167422891af0f7ebc2d7359ac9", "ja": "ややウケでしたか。\n……やっちゃったぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "不怎么好笑吗？\n……你搞砸了喔，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a6072a401bb47b5917c3ca87802a03096c0d373b589cdf9638e2be0a8186859", "ja": "ええと……まあ、瑞希さんらしいですけど。\nどうするんですか？　この空気……。", "zh": "这个……说起来是很有瑞希的风格，\n但现在这种气氛该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "49b2404032ead4f5dc0920006f73140ff7f5a9df0ff2d9e5d58129fdc447cee0", "ja": "はい。ここはひとつ、手品でリカバリーを狙います。\nおふたりとも、アシスタントをお願いします。", "zh": "好，这时候就用魔术挽救气氛吧。\n两位，拜托你们担任助手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "9d3235f98c085b9c5ac4c26d81947aadff134677eddcc221641df9fdbeb4184c", "ja": "えっ……手品って、本気でやるんですか？", "zh": "咦……你是认真要表演魔术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "781a14d4624e68021b55570b82298a4f08157efb4d055f6a40fc0fec5c92ccaa", "ja": "あ、アシスタントって、なにするん……？", "zh": "助、助手要干嘛……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "107842053ae29c99aaa48abdd7082276b0c5666044925673971a5643dab80088", "ja": "（いやいや、手品はダメだから！　時間もかなり\n押してるし……おーい、誰かこっちを見てくれ！）", "zh": "（不行不行，不能表演魔术！\n已经超时很多了……喂～谁快注意到我这边啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0979a4d805425d8471b6441d39c2d46c25982f1cebeb123a25bdee4fea25e2ce", "ja": "あ、あの、真壁さん！\nもう時間やし、そろそろ締めに移らんと……！", "zh": "那、那个，真壁！\n时间已经到啦，要赶紧收尾……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "d2141968be643b2721674265ae8323ddc5188bd648f4a55e8eb1f23a42576f9f", "ja": "そうでした。\nすみません。手品は、また今度にしましょう。", "zh": "差点忘了。\n抱歉，下次再表演魔术给各位看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "3e4251ee6f3a03337f2f84091ef018fd44f2aaa958b29535100ac2cba848e2b0", "ja": "ええと……PVは、近々公開される予定です。\nみなさん、楽しみにしていてくださいね。", "zh": "还有……PV预定会在近期公开，\n各位敬请期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "936a18dd48b4826e86e2281ecf9eb32c08dd4455cb45a338a43d86248ab0bf21", "ja": "是非、ご感想をお待ちいたしております。", "zh": "请务必将感想告诉我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "447a8f3e9d5a8f41ea1018f3519d68e28c38bbd8338c4ee2017e0530a910a10d", "ja": "それでは、また次の公演でお会いしましょう。\n……せーのっ。", "zh": "那么，我们下次公演再见吧。\n……一、二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "18cb1dde707068ab9c4802f1e0b05432cafa0edb9d83ad9f2d91cebbc9bfbf0a", "ja": "ありがとうございました……！", "zh": "感谢各位……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "18cb1dde707068ab9c4802f1e0b05432cafa0edb9d83ad9f2d91cebbc9bfbf0a", "ja": "ありがとうございました……！", "zh": "感谢各位……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "18cb1dde707068ab9c4802f1e0b05432cafa0edb9d83ad9f2d91cebbc9bfbf0a", "ja": "ありがとうございました……！", "zh": "感谢各位……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1026_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "ebaf320fcc31843531c101c36d71c64dea2b791464c44279fd6f293bd07adc43", "ja": "ワーーーッ！！！", "zh": "哗───！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7cb7c959a758a7cc76751c1dab3131234a56473dca8460b099553ccae826d263", "ja": "（ふう、どうにかまとまったか……よかった）", "zh": "（呼，总算顺利收尾了吗……太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "232096ae5a1c0a33329d3c31cbcdaed9064e570b0f5ae772eaea7ee4d23200e1", "ja": "（歓声に手を振り返しながら、3人が舞台袖に\n戻ってくる。その姿は晴れやかで、誇らしげだ）", "zh": "（三人一边对欢呼声挥手致意，一边返回舞台侧边。\n她们看上去光辉灿烂，十分自豪。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "eb5b0fda3bccf0674897e131ef52a1e658341a5758e719fbc834527b168ba317", "ja": "（あの輝かしい笑顔こそ、アンドロイド達が\n命を懸けて守りたかったものなのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（仿生人们豁出性命也想守护的，\n说不定就是那般灿烂的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
